{"id":"pilot_tariff_target_2024","split":"pilot","title":"Target bilateral oilseed tariff on the bundled aggregation","difficulty":"basic","expected_behavior":"run","prompt":"Using the available 2024 policy baseline and the existing aggregation, suppose East Asia raises its tariff on oilseed imports from North America to 20 percent. Keep the ordinary policy closure, run the experiment, and explain the main GDP, welfare, terms-of-trade, grains-and-crops output, and bilateral export effects.","reference_plan":{"aggregation":{"mode":"existing","model_name":"gtap2015_10x10","changes":[]},"baseline_id":"registered_2024","closure":{"id":"standard_policy","patches":[]},"shocks":[{"semantic_type":"bilateral_import_tariff","commodity":"Oil seeds","exporter":"NAmerica","importer":"EastAsia","value":20.0,"value_mode":"target_rate","expected_code":"tms"}],"result_queries":[{"view":"solution","variable":"qxs","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"NAmerica","destination_region":"EastAsia"}}],"forbidden_operations":["aggregate_gtap_model","aggregate_custom_gtap_model","build_2024_baseline_update","modify_gtap_closure"]},"target_outputs":[{"key":"qxs_grains_namerica_eastasia","variable":"qxs","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"NAmerica","destination_region":"EastAsia"}},{"key":"ev_eastasia","variable":"EV","unit":"value_change","dimensions":{"region":"EastAsia"}},{"key":"tot_eastasia","variable":"tot","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"EastAsia"}}],"tags":["tariff","target_rate","existing_aggregation","registered_2024"]}
{"id":"pilot_tariff_rate_change_2014","split":"pilot","title":"Percentage-point tariff increase","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_behavior":"run","prompt":"Start from the original GTAP data and retain the current aggregation and normal policy closure. Increase East Asia's tariff on grains-and-crops imports from North America by 5 percentage points rather than setting a final tariff level. Run the scenario and report the bilateral trade response together with regional GDP, welfare and terms-of-trade effects.","reference_plan":{"aggregation":{"mode":"existing","model_name":"gtap2015_10x10","changes":[]},"baseline_id":"original_2014","closure":{"id":"standard_policy","patches":[]},"shocks":[{"semantic_type":"bilateral_import_tariff","commodity":"GrainsCrops","exporter":"NAmerica","importer":"EastAsia","value":5.0,"value_mode":"rate_change","expected_code":"tms"}],"result_queries":[{"view":"solution","variable":"qxs","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"NAmerica","destination_region":"EastAsia"}}],"forbidden_operations":["aggregate_gtap_model","aggregate_custom_gtap_model","build_2024_baseline_update","modify_gtap_closure"]},"target_outputs":[{"key":"qxs_grains_namerica_eastasia","variable":"qxs","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"NAmerica","destination_region":"EastAsia"}},{"key":"qgdp_eastasia","variable":"qgdp","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"EastAsia"}},{"key":"ev_eastasia","variable":"EV","unit":"value_change","dimensions":{"region":"EastAsia"}}],"tags":["tariff","rate_change","original_2014"]}
{"id":"pilot_minimal_disaggregation_gdp_tariff","split":"pilot","title":"Minimal China-US-oilseed disaggregation with GDP target","difficulty":"advanced","expected_behavior":"run","prompt":"I want to study a joint scenario in which China achieves 3 percent more real GDP than in the starting database through the economy-wide productivity adjustment implied by the model, while China raises its soybean import tariff on the United States to 25 percent. The current 10-by-10 aggregation is too coarse for this question, so make only the minimum necessary refinement that identifies China, the United States and soybeans separately while preserving everything else. Use the original GTAP database, run the experiment, and focus on U.S. soybean exports to China, China's required productivity adjustment, GDP, welfare, terms of trade and relevant output effects.","reference_plan":{"aggregation":{"mode":"local_change","base_model":"gtap2015_10x10","region_changes":[{"member":"chn","new_group":"China"},{"member":"usa","new_group":"US"}],"sector_changes":[{"member":"osd","new_group":"OilSeeds"}],"preserve_unlisted":true},"baseline_id":"original_2014","closure":{"id":"standard_policy_patched","patches":[{"type":"gdp_target_tfp","regions":["China"]}],"expected_swaps":["Swap avareg(China) = qgdp(China)"]},"shocks":[{"semantic_type":"regional_gdp_target","region":"China","value":3.0,"value_mode":"percent_change","expected_code":"qgdp"},{"semantic_type":"bilateral_import_tariff","commodity":"OilSeeds","exporter":"US","importer":"China","value":25.0,"value_mode":"target_rate","expected_code":"tms"}],"result_queries":[{"view":"solution","variable":"qxs","dimensions":{"sector":"OilSeeds","source_region":"US","destination_region":"China"}},{"view":"solution","variable":"avareg","dimensions":{"region":"China"}}],"forbidden_operations":["aggregate_gtap_model","build_2024_baseline_update","set_as_default_baseline","overwrite_default_model"]},"target_outputs":[{"key":"qxs_oilseeds_us_china","variable":"qxs","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"sector":"OilSeeds","source_region":"US","destination_region":"China"}},{"key":"avareg_china","variable":"avareg","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"China"}},{"key":"ev_china","variable":"EV","unit":"value_change","dimensions":{"region":"China"}},{"key":"ev_us","variable":"EV","unit":"value_change","dimensions":{"region":"US"}}],"tags":["custom_aggregation","closure_patch","gdp_target","tariff","multi_shock"]}
{"id":"pilot_tariff_productivity_combo","split":"pilot","title":"Tariff diversion with Latin American productivity","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_behavior":"run","prompt":"Use the registered 2024 baseline, current aggregation and standard policy closure. Consider a scenario where East Asia sets a 30 percent tariff on oilseed imports from North America while grains-and-crops production technology in Latin America improves by 2 percent. Run it and explain the main macroeconomic, welfare, terms-of-trade, output and bilateral export responses, especially shipments to East Asia from North America and Latin America.","reference_plan":{"aggregation":{"mode":"existing","model_name":"gtap2015_10x10","changes":[]},"baseline_id":"registered_2024","closure":{"id":"standard_policy","patches":[]},"shocks":[{"semantic_type":"bilateral_import_tariff","commodity":"Oil seeds","exporter":"NAmerica","importer":"EastAsia","value":30.0,"value_mode":"target_rate","expected_code":"tms"},{"semantic_type":"output_technology","sector":"GrainsCrops","region":"LatinAmer","value":2.0,"value_mode":"percent_change","expected_code":"aoall"}],"result_queries":[{"view":"solution","variable":"qxs","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"NAmerica","destination_region":"EastAsia"}},{"view":"solution","variable":"qxs","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"LatinAmer","destination_region":"EastAsia"}}],"forbidden_operations":["aggregate_gtap_model","aggregate_custom_gtap_model","build_2024_baseline_update","modify_gtap_closure"]},"target_outputs":[{"key":"qxs_grains_namerica_eastasia","variable":"qxs","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"NAmerica","destination_region":"EastAsia"}},{"key":"qxs_grains_latinamer_eastasia","variable":"qxs","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","source_region":"LatinAmer","destination_region":"EastAsia"}},{"key":"qo_grains_latinamer","variable":"qo","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"sector":"GrainsCrops","region":"LatinAmer"}}],"tags":["tariff","technology","multi_shock","trade_diversion"]}
{"id":"pilot_capital_endowment","split":"pilot","title":"Regional capital-supply expansion","difficulty":"basic","expected_behavior":"run","prompt":"Using the original GTAP database and the existing aggregation, examine a 5 percent expansion in South Asia's capital endowment under the normal policy closure. Run the model and summarize South Asia's real GDP, welfare, terms of trade and sector-output responses, including the capital endowment result used by the model.","reference_plan":{"aggregation":{"mode":"existing","model_name":"gtap2015_10x10","changes":[]},"baseline_id":"original_2014","closure":{"id":"standard_policy","patches":[]},"shocks":[{"semantic_type":"factor_endowment","factor":"Capital","region":"SouthAsia","value":5.0,"value_mode":"percent_change","expected_code":"qo"}],"result_queries":[{"view":"solution","variable":"qo","dimensions":{"factor":"Capital","region":"SouthAsia"}}],"forbidden_operations":["aggregate_gtap_model","aggregate_custom_gtap_model","build_2024_baseline_update","modify_gtap_closure"]},"target_outputs":[{"key":"qgdp_southasia","variable":"qgdp","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"SouthAsia"}},{"key":"ev_southasia","variable":"EV","unit":"value_change","dimensions":{"region":"SouthAsia"}},{"key":"qo_capital_southasia","variable":"qo","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"factor":"Capital","region":"SouthAsia"}}],"tags":["factor_supply","capital","original_2014"]}
{"id":"pilot_shipping_technology","split":"pilot","title":"Importer-side shipping technology improvement","difficulty":"intermediate","expected_behavior":"run","prompt":"From the registered 2024 baseline, keep the current aggregation and normal closure and simulate a 3 percent improvement in international shipping technology for deliveries to the EU_28 region. Run the experiment and report EU_28 GDP, welfare, terms of trade, aggregate import-volume effects and the most affected sector outputs.","reference_plan":{"aggregation":{"mode":"existing","model_name":"gtap2015_10x10","changes":[]},"baseline_id":"registered_2024","closure":{"id":"standard_policy","patches":[]},"shocks":[{"semantic_type":"gtap_variable","code":"atd","importer":"EU_28","value":3.0,"value_mode":"percent_change"}],"result_queries":[{"view":"solution","variable":"qiwreg","dimensions":{"region":"EU_28"}}],"forbidden_operations":["aggregate_gtap_model","aggregate_custom_gtap_model","build_2024_baseline_update","modify_gtap_closure"]},"target_outputs":[{"key":"qgdp_eu28","variable":"qgdp","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"EU_28"}},{"key":"ev_eu28","variable":"EV","unit":"value_change","dimensions":{"region":"EU_28"}},{"key":"tot_eu28","variable":"tot","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"EU_28"}},{"key":"qiwreg_eu28","variable":"qiwreg","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"EU_28"}}],"tags":["shipping_technology","imports","registered_2024"]}
{"id":"pilot_fixed_investment","split":"pilot","title":"Fixed regional investment with population growth","difficulty":"advanced","expected_behavior":"run","prompt":"Use the original GTAP database and current aggregation. Suppose South Asia's population rises by 1.5 percent while its real investment volume is held at the baseline level. Make only the closure adjustment needed to impose that investment assumption, run the model, and report South Asia's GDP, welfare, terms of trade, investment and major output responses.","reference_plan":{"aggregation":{"mode":"existing","model_name":"gtap2015_10x10","changes":[]},"baseline_id":"original_2014","closure":{"id":"standard_policy_patched","patches":[{"type":"fixed_regional_investment","regions":["SouthAsia"]}],"expected_swaps":["Swap cgdslack(SouthAsia) = qcgds(SouthAsia)"]},"shocks":[{"semantic_type":"regional_population","region":"SouthAsia","value":1.5,"value_mode":"percent_change","expected_code":"pop"},{"semantic_type":"regional_investment_target","region":"SouthAsia","value":0.0,"value_mode":"percent_change","expected_code":"qcgds"}],"result_queries":[{"view":"solution","variable":"qcgds","dimensions":{"region":"SouthAsia"}},{"view":"solution","variable":"cgdslack","dimensions":{"region":"SouthAsia"}}],"forbidden_operations":["aggregate_gtap_model","aggregate_custom_gtap_model","build_2024_baseline_update"]},"target_outputs":[{"key":"qgdp_southasia","variable":"qgdp","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"SouthAsia"}},{"key":"ev_southasia","variable":"EV","unit":"value_change","dimensions":{"region":"SouthAsia"}},{"key":"cgdslack_southasia","variable":"cgdslack","unit":"percent_change","dimensions":{"region":"SouthAsia"}}],"tags":["closure_patch","investment_target","population","multi_shock"]}
